    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In a metro system 100 years after the world ended in 2005, you set out to find a way to escape to the surface.<br>Will you find out the truth about this world?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the open world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Travel from station to station </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10s of thousands of custom weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enemies that react to the changing tides of battle and have their own affiliations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tehnically an infinite variety of enemies  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight bosses in any order you want </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diverse cast of characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-depth weapon crafting system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique endurance based gameplay loop.</p></li></ul>",
